Usage: agent-deck events publish --kind macapp.<name> [--session <id>] [--data <json> | --data-file <path|->] [--profile <name>] [--json]
Needs [macapp] plugins = true, except the Mac app's own frames: macapp.open,
macapp.open.ack, macapp.browser.response and macapp.app.focus;
to enable it, run: agent-deck config set macapp.plugins true --yes (docs/macapp-core.md).
  -data string
    	JSON object payload
  -data-file string
    	read the JSON payload from this file, or - for stdin
  -from-remote
    	set by a forwarded remote <name> events publish: only the Mac app's reply kinds, data on stdin, and --session must be a session of this host
  -json
    	print {ok, kind, session_id, cursor} as JSON
  -kind string
    	frame kind; must be in the macapp.* namespace
  -profile string
    	publish on this existing profile's log instead of the process profile
  -session string
    	session id the frame is about (default: the current session, $AGENTDECK_INSTANCE_ID)
